{"id":"410370813","kind":"article","title":"间隔重复记忆系统在多大程度上能算作刻意练习？","author":"Andy Matuschak","original_authors":["Andy Matuschak"],"original_source_urls":["https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z2DFcZfqWxS8wd6ccX7WB7TvT6gVQtqS6GCCp"],"publisher":"Thoughts Memo","column":"间隔重复 & 注意力管理","date":"2021-09-14","updated":"2022-10-29","votes":11,"comment_count":0,"minutes":1,"chars":434,"keywords":["间隔重复","刻意练习","反馈","技能发展"],"summary":"短注权衡间隔重复复习是否算刻意练习：它有明确改善表现的目的，也会通过算法多安排薄弱卡片；但反馈粗略，单张卡通常轻松到不像在挑战技能边界。作者未下定论，并链接刻意练习相关概念。","zhihu_url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/410370813","restoration":null,"toc":[{"id":"sec-1","level":2,"title":"链接至本文（已汉化）"},{"id":"sec-2","level":2,"title":"声明"}],"html":"<p data-pid=\"cjAEPFz-\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z4eXdSMJFv2qVGXSUEKH4vdcHBrLHcFY1ZGfC\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">间隔重复记忆系统</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup>复习环节是否能算作<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z2duRd5eisRomSgxr88Semkgs15pgMRVVR5C\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">刻意练习 (术语来自 Anders Ericsson)</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-2\"><a href=\"#ref-2\">[2]</a></sup>？</p><ul><li data-pid=\"MJdPex8Z\">支持算作刻意练习的证据：<br/></li><ul><li data-pid=\"UkEtCJvj\">复习显然是为了学得更好，其本身并不一定愉快</li><li data-pid=\"rMbx5tJb\">指数退避算法有点像聚焦于弱点练习（译者注：指数退避算法指改变卡片复习间隔的算法，记不清的卡片的间隔缩短得更快）</li></ul></ul><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><ul><li data-pid=\"bQ6b5m6c\">不支持算作刻意练习的证据：<br/></li><ul><li data-pid=\"BKULPaoc\">间隔重复系统的监控只能粗略模仿专家教练的行为</li><li data-pid=\"ufBImaB4\">复习通常没那么费力，就其本身来说，甚至很顺畅，要么知道，要么不知道。这样似乎没有挑战稳态的感觉：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z4V56SvpNAHuaWSkU9U319uTxqBppv1mRx3aE\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">技能发展需要挑战稳态</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-3\"><a href=\"#ref-3\">[3]</a></sup></li></ul></ul><h2 id=\"sec-1\">链接至本文（已汉化）</h2><ul><li data-pid=\"yN-AZVco\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"404257681\" href=\"#/post/404257681\">间隔重复记忆系统</a></li></ul><h2 id=\"sec-2\">声明</h2><p data-pid=\"Or6bSkkZ\">此内容发布由 Andy Matuschak 许可。未经允许，不得转载或修改。保留所有权利。</p><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><blockquote data-pid=\"mP9DMTd2\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://paratranz.cn/projects/3131\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Thoughts Memo</a> 汉化组译制<br/>原文：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z2DFcZfqWxS8wd6ccX7WB7TvT6gVQtqS6GCCp\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">To what extent does spaced repetition memory system practice constitute deliberate practice?</a></blockquote><hr/><ol class=\"references\"><li id=\"ref-1\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-1\">↩</a> 间隔重复记忆系统 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"404257681\" href=\"#/post/404257681\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-2\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-2\">↩</a> 刻意练习，来自 Ericsson <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"578329400\" href=\"#/post/578329400\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-3\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-3\">↩</a> 发展技能需要挑战稳态 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"422370272\" href=\"#/post/422370272\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li></ol>","rec_chain":[{"id":"409524135","title":"规律进行间隔重复记忆练习是沉重的习惯","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":24,"minutes":2,"reason":"同专栏上一篇 · 间隔重复 & 注意力管理"},{"id":"411854751","title":"RemNote","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":18,"minutes":1,"reason":"同专栏下一篇 · 间隔重复 & 注意力管理"},{"id":"578329400","title":"刻意练习，来自 Ericsson","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":9,"minutes":2,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"422370272","title":"发展技能需要挑战稳态","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":11,"minutes":2,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"404257681","title":"间隔重复记忆系统（Spaced repetition memory system）","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":88,"minutes":16,"reason":"本文直接引用"}],"rec_bridge":[{"id":"22816938382","title":"达到前 5% 的水平其实并不怎么样","author":"Dan Luu","votes":531,"minutes":29,"reason":"跨作者共鸣「反馈」· Dan Luu"}],"rec_answers":[]}